<title>UK: UK Treasury says reserves data delayed slightly.</title>
<headline>UK Treasury says reserves data delayed slightly.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The British Treasury said on Monday official reserves data for July would be slightly delayed from its scheduled 0830 GMT release time due to a technical problem.</p>
<p>A Treasury official said the data would be released as soon as possible.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6784</p>
